{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8f2af70ee792163c85cba42bc9169414795fd4f36e69f8a399cf042e1c099966", "ja": "（真美が主演したドラマ、『ヨシツネ伝』の\n主題歌発売記念ライブが終了した！）", "zh": "（真美主演的电视剧《义经传》的\n主题曲发售纪念演唱会落幕了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "52943478c883bca1349e0b87a6021442660580da1c405a9cb74b6ec85fbe197d", "ja": "ファンの兄ちゃん姉ちゃん～！　今日は真美と一緒に\n盛り上がってくれてー、ありがとね～！", "zh": "粉丝的大哥哥、大姊姊们～！\n谢谢你们今天和真美一起嗨翻全场～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1002_null", "source_sha256": "95ccd1cf977a63b1235c80b07b938067e55fc8b66ac6d574b2a6f2106f1614b3", "ja": "ワァ～っ！！", "zh": "哗啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "8ebfb533e2c989d384085c5fa54b7169367593db23d0a95ede9c4244f9f62074", "ja": "いやぁ～、お疲れちゃんちゃん、兄ちゃんちゃ～ん！\n真美のウシワカマルっぷり、どうだった？", "zh": "哎呀～辛苦啦啦，大哥哥哥～！\n真美演的牛若丸怎么样啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f22c475c111d76e64bbed9e311d79f669d75fe1f4fef0581baf670ca03b77fb4", "ja": "お疲れさま、真美！　ああ、すごかったぞ。\n観客も大盛り上がりだ！", "zh": "真美，辛苦你了！嗯，非常传神喔。\n观众们的气氛也相当热烈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1005_p", "source_sha256": "def5948a08e481aed0f7607c8df08b5d6a02a145d8934964e0ed64813776b151", "ja": "特に、動きがすごく良かったな。\n本当の牛若丸みたいに軽やかだったぞ！", "zh": "尤其是你那动作，\n真的就像牛若丸一样身轻如燕呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "e9f81d939df55f199de8d4af6d3ab0df8e470f9cf2eadff8247b66853c1ecdfa", "ja": "うんうん。ドラマの中で真美、テングのおっちゃんの\nトコで、メッチャ修行したかんね！", "zh": "嗯嗯，电视剧里的真美，\n也在天狗大叔那历经了一番修行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "9e44467af7ce08dcee598d040752f6c03da626b10f8ae3390f5535149ecd33a1", "ja": "ステージを飛びはねるくらい、気の流れを感じとれば\nヨユウなのじゃ！　感じるのじゃ！　あっは～ん♪", "zh": "只要能抓到气的流动，飞跃整个舞台\n根本不在话下！要去感受啊！啊哈～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1008_p", "source_sha256": "fb2369b17abce3eda99b12aa0d55b62b88e5a620b18ce2aa8a9c17b0979437a5", "ja": "そういう感じ方じゃないと思うが、\nとにかくヨシツネ役、いい経験になったみたいだな？", "zh": "我觉得应该不是这样感受才对，\n总之义经这个角色，对你而言应该是不错的体验吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "b05f83fab34d4e3a6ac4a0e4af8815ed61fe591fde8d1d5464197d76c850a40a", "ja": "うん、勉強になったよ～。\n兄弟ゲンカも、こじれると命がけだよね～。", "zh": "嗯，学到好多东西～\n兄弟阋墙越演越烈最后还要赌上性命呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3802f71a8c9ddc47997f296c8f7861741c352b22a5b87308b2c5145d239e16bd", "ja": "……そこは参考にしなくていいんじゃないか？", "zh": "……这点你就不用学了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "a74a486ac355f59f35b49c31e5c516d628078bc52d3ffcea5273ae232a9ab69a", "ja": "えっ。でも真美も亜美と、けっこうつまんないことで\nホンキのケンカしたりするよ？　キレッキレだよ？", "zh": "咦？可是真美也很常因为一些小事情\n和亚美真的吵起来耶，是真的吵得很凶喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1012_p", "source_sha256": "057185d3b11cc67788f7432cc57a72bba5e5c8ac0c5f179921c80d9177f00a37", "ja": "うーん、でも、すぐに仲直りできるだろ？", "zh": "嗯……但你们马上就能和好不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "fea7688102a1f77ecb5af8e2fbc06dafb3a4ec7d45821504ff363cff7f6a0761", "ja": "あ……。うん、そだね、わりとスグ。\n言いたいこと言えば、だいたい終わるし♪", "zh": "啊……嗯，说得也是，真的很快就和好了。\n各自讲完想讲的，基本上就结束了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "cca4687919ea0f6911bf0ca8cca9d7e9d91e1b178d11c27c502cf1067fdbf656", "ja": "なのにウシワカマル兄弟は、なんにも言わないの。\nヘンなことばっか気にして。だからダメなんだよね～。", "zh": "但牛若丸那对兄弟却什么都不说，\n就爱纠结一些奇怪的事情，所以最后才会弄成这样～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1015_p", "source_sha256": "7bf094a29ed7ff212f29010600fafb8cf3b29e5406b9f00e80836cd0680814ef", "ja": "（そうか。兄弟への想いは、兄弟がいるからこそ\n分かることもあったんだろうな……）", "zh": "（我懂了，正是因为她有手足，\n才让她对手足的想法也有自己的体悟吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1016_p", "source_sha256": "dda7b58c3fbee98c4dff0a3260cf7c00a5b4e1573ef8f8fce9b40cb110eec47d", "ja": "もしかしたら真美は、亜美のおかげで、\n今回いい演技ができたのかもしれないぞ？", "zh": "说不定真美是托亚美的福，\n此次才能把角色诠释得这么好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "313bace7b76eb4fc817a12b861e89211e8e6dc89712ba4ee629d56269a9ac445", "ja": "うあうあ！　なにそれ兄ちゃん！\nウシワカマル役、本気でがんばったのは真美なのに～！", "zh": "呜哇呜哇！大哥哥你胡说什么！\n认真在演牛若丸的明明就是真美～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1018_p", "source_sha256": "b8c4e4419452360616c954d7f542ee41c2c6d83432af562096ca672bdb84fb48", "ja": "おっと、ごめんごめん！　そうだったな。\n今回は真美の本気を、しっかり見せてもらったよ！", "zh": "哎呀，抱歉抱歉！说得也是。\n这回我是真的见识到真美的实力了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "00b784d74d9e41c12d19aa8d94e08c29c739eb89bf3ba22b510e766677eadef4", "ja": "んっふっふ～、ならよろしい。1000年の眠りから\n目覚めた真美のホンキ、よ～く覚えといてくれたまえ！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～那就好。真美沉睡了千年的实力，\n你就好～好记在心底吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ae7f582fd7bb48dcc63a28d32cde67ccd3e5545b5bf791a5b70c7725f8aff1c8", "ja": "……あんまり眠らせ過ぎないようにな？", "zh": "……拜托你别让它一直睡好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1021_012mam", "source_sha256": "208d7ddf7d778d99548bae7995319181c7232bad95e66fc77c5038272f7f74b3", "ja": "うん、大丈夫！　真美のホンキは、ちゃ～んと\nファンの兄ちゃん姉ちゃん達にも伝わってるっしょ！", "zh": "嗯，别担心！认真发挥起来的真美，\n粉丝的大哥哥、大姊姊们一～定也有感受到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1022_012mam", "source_sha256": "709d930ceaedc235f86c9869e5022fea60fb2ed75d2084bd18c406ead4c0840d", "ja": "さっき、カントクにもほめられちゃったしー。", "zh": "而且刚才导演还称赞了人家～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1023_p", "source_sha256": "bea8e43bf4519f1aa7f745c34b3d021c1326efc0843ac031733f88525b3567f2", "ja": "あ、『ヨシツネ伝』の監督、こっちにいらしてたのか。\n入れ違ってしまったな……。", "zh": "啊，《义经传》的导演也有来吗？\n看来我跟他擦肩而过了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1024_012mam", "source_sha256": "acd8c1cea7474fa321ada93cebbaf7a3b8dbddd67e5d56b2020c97adea0a3882", "ja": "うん、真美のライブ、初めて見たけど\nメッチャカンドーしたって！", "zh": "嗯，他第一次来看真美的演唱会，\n说自己超感动的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1025_p", "source_sha256": "94c01ede22787e546c868aabf1f2fa314ff221af9c14249fa7b453f60e4ce07b", "ja": "それは良かった。ドラマも好評だったし、\nぜひ次の仕事につなげたいところだけど……。", "zh": "那真是太好了。电视剧也广受好评，\n希望这能带来下一份工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1026_012mam", "source_sha256": "0866f79809cb4afcf25911ddeb2cb23726dde1387b776f04a15392a22f5aff81", "ja": "あ、そういえばカントク、『ヨシツネ伝～第二章～』\nやっちゃいましょうよー、って言ってたよ？", "zh": "啊，说起来导演讲了\n「来拍《义经传～第二章～》吧～」这种话喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1027_p", "source_sha256": "d42d26d2f7f892776458c770a13145afddbd6c4012f769863bf527cc63774781", "ja": "え！？　本当か？", "zh": "咦！？真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1028_012mam", "source_sha256": "7e121f221fd8e5a02882fa96e84fe002a50c35b75645c609a1b5b2705320bec4", "ja": "うん、兄ちゃんに伝えてって。", "zh": "嗯，还叫真美要转达给大哥哥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1029_p", "source_sha256": "d5e2ed87235ddfe3c9fd358629a5e2435dd0399eac1cd7108d750c7da84d381c", "ja": "（早く伝えてくれ！）", "zh": "（你怎么不早讲！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1030_012mam", "source_sha256": "a10256369e00d1dd717eb63a6c8f43a143af777f9b47b88ed9696bf5100ff34d", "ja": "そんでね、ライブにカンドーしたから、\n次は歌とダンスもやっちゃいましょー、だって！", "zh": "然后啊，他因为看了演唱会深受感动，\n还说下次要唱歌跳舞～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1031_p", "source_sha256": "a714cb070e89d22d1d376f0f93fe99e5677e60f6db0c9f0d4ef52d79a3913ddc", "ja": "ミュージカルってことか？\nそれはすごい！", "zh": "要做成音乐剧的意思吗？\n太厉害了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1032_p", "source_sha256": "937fb73223e9ac51cf86f48d231ec69503979e3ea1001a3a2d957cf4097e8305", "ja": "（話題性も十分だし、それをきっかけにドラマが\nシリーズ化されたりも……ありえない話じゃない！）", "zh": "（这可是话题性十足，电视剧就此\n发展成长青节目……也不无可能！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1033_p", "source_sha256": "556fceee35c24327ea56b72fa030ddbe044500a4fd5e33d52225f7445cd0af7f", "ja": "そうだ、監督、まだ近くにいるよな？\n詳しい話を聞いてくるよ！", "zh": "对了，导演应该还没走远对吧？\n我去找他问问详细的计划！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1034_012mam", "source_sha256": "f90df7567ffb3bc570ce8bae26a0f797e51e0e5a395171a3442b3900065c8e34", "ja": "うん、いってらっぴょーん！\nそっか～、あの話の続きができるんだ～♪", "zh": "嗯，路上小心～！\n这样啊～真美还能演那个故事的后续～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0084_1035_012mam", "source_sha256": "69fc2ce26506e113ad5aa89bb8b0987726503bf53636aa7966cdcbdf28852d08", "ja": "前のドラマの最後にヨシツネ死んじゃってるけど、\n第二章、どうなるのかな～兄ちゃん！", "zh": "义经在之前电视剧的最后死掉了，\n第二章会有什么发展呢～大哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
